activity Submit Application
activity Review Application
activity Approve Application
activity Reject Application
activity Implement Arrangement
activity Monitor Arrangement
activity Adjust Arrangement
activity Terminate Arrangement
bind Submit Application: Application ID, Arrangement Type
bind Review Application: Application ID, Review Score, Application Status
bind Approve Application: Application ID, Application Status
bind Reject Application: Application ID, Application Status
bind Implement Arrangement: Application ID, Application Status, Hours Per Week
bind Monitor Arrangement: Application ID, Application Status
bind Adjust Arrangement: Application ID, Application Status, Hours Per Week
bind Terminate Arrangement: Application ID, Application Status
Application ID: integer between 1 and 1000
Arrangement Type: Remote Work, Flextime, Compressed Workweek, Job Sharing
Review Score: integer between 1 and 5
Application Status: Submitted, Reviewed, Approved, Rejected, Implemented, Terminated
Hours Per Week: float between 10.0 and 40.0
Init[Submit Application] | |
Response[Submit Application, Review Application] | | |
Precedence[Approve Application, Review Application] | | |
Precedence[Reject Application, Review Application] | | |
Not Co-Existence[Submit Application, Review Application] | | |
Exclusive Choice[Approve Application, Reject Application] | | |
Response[Approve Application, Implement Arrangement] | | |
Succession[Implement Arrangement, Monitor Arrangement] | | |
Response[Monitor Arrangement, Adjust Arrangement] | | |
Response[Approve Application, Terminate Arrangement] |A.Application Status is Approved | |
Not Response[Reject Application, Terminate Arrangement] | | |